<para>
  The <classname>Angle2Color</classname> class is used to convert
  <link
  linkend="RegisteredClass-Orientation"><classname>Orientations</classname></link>
  to <link
  linkend="RegisteredClass-OpaqueColor"><classname>Colors</classname></link>,
  either for display purposes (see <xref
  linkend="RegisteredClass-OrientationDisplay"/> and <xref
  linkend="RegisteredClass-OrientationMapDisplay"/>) or for converting
  <link
  linkend="Section-Concepts-Microstructure-OrientationMap"><classname>Orientation
  Maps</classname></link> to &images; (see <xref
  linkend="MenuItem-OOF.OrientationMap.Convert_to_Image"/>).
</para>

